    (erased (NBl es evs e) nb) (erased (Offs (Succ h) o) of) (erased (Offs (Succ (Succ h)) e) oe) (erased (UcA vs cs N) ua) (erased (Sz cnt-w vs N) zv)
    (erased (Nat) j p d) (erased (List (Col)) pre) (erased (RIdx pre p) ri) (erased (Length (Col) pre d) lp) (erased (Add d j (Succ h)) ad)
    (erased (List RS) ps) (erased (RxL (GSet) ps) pl) (erased (SPath (Cons RS (MkRx (GSet) (BS0) (GSG gtu)) (Nil RS)) pre ps) sp) (erased (ES) st) (erased (EsAt pre st) ea)
    (erased (Ctree) t) (subterm erased (Tally vs j p t) tb) -> (erased (GE t ps st j) g) (erased (CEv t st) ce) (erased (CtH j t) hk))
